      "v": 3,
      "zh": "那日，我必使耶路撒冷向聚集攻击他的万民当作一块重石头；凡举起的必受重伤。",
      "en": "Moreover, on that day I will make Jerusalem a heavy burden[NOTE:1] for all the nations, and all who try to carry it will be seriously injured;[NOTE:2] yet all the peoples of the earth will be assembled against it.",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “heavy stone” (so NRSV, TEV, NLT); KJV “burdensome stone”; NIV “an immovable rock.”",
